	('The light turned red','Đèn chuyển sang màu đỏ','00:00:58.880','00:01:00.940','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Jeb stopped','Jeb dừng xe lại','00:01:01.600','00:01:03.399','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Zippy whispered to Eddie','Zippy thì thầm với Eddie','00:01:04.280','00:01:06.640','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('You\'re good at slowing down','Cậu giỏi giảm tốc độ đấy','00:01:07.320','00:01:09.200','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Because you\'re slow','Vì cậu vốn chậm mà','00:01:10.040','00:01:12.140','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('I\'m not slow, said Eddie','Tớ không chậm đâu, Eddie nói','00:01:13.000','00:01:15.780','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('The light turned green','Đèn chuyển sang màu xanh','00:01:16.560','00:01:18.600','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Jeb drove some more','Jeb tiếp tục lái xe','00:01:21.180','00:01:22.980','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Soon he was done','Chẳng mấy chốc, cậu đã hoàn thành','00:01:26.930','00:01:28.710','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Good job, said Ms. Fender','Làm tốt lắm, cô Fender nói','00:01:33.070','00:01:36.210','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('It\'s Zippy\'s turn now','Bây giờ đến lượt Zippy','00:01:36.710','00:01:38.990','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Zippy drove to the track','Zippy lái xe đến đường tập lái','00:01:43.040','00:01:45.740','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('Zippy smiled','Zippy mỉm cười','00:01:46.800','00:01:48.820','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
	('This will be easy','Chuyện này sẽ dễ thôi','00:01:48.920','00:01:51.120','little-cat-tire-town-school-10'),
