	('Sorry, said Poppy','Xin lỗi ạ, Poppy nói','00:01:17.500','00:01:20.240','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('La, la, la, la!','La, la, la, la!','00:01:21.840','00:01:24.180','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('Poppy sang','Poppy hát vang','00:01:24.000','00:01:25.520','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('She drove past the stop sign','Cô bé lái xe vượt qua biển báo dừng','00:01:26.540','00:01:29.180','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('You didn\'t stop, cried Ms. Fender','Cháu đã không dừng lại!, cô Fender kêu lên','00:01:30.460','00:01:34.220','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
