	('Then it was Eddie\'s turn','Sau đó đến lượt Eddie','00:01:39.540','00:01:41.660','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('Remember, Eddie, said Ms. Fender','Nhớ nhé, Eddie, cô Fender nhắc nhở','00:01:43.680','00:01:46.500','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
