	('Ha, ha, ha!','Ha, ha, ha!','00:01:52.280','00:01:53.420','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('Don\'t worry, Ms. Fender','Đừng lo, cô Fender ạ','00:01:53.120','00:01:54.740','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
	('Eddie won\'t go too fast','Eddie sẽ không chạy nhanh quá đâu','00:01:55.460','00:01:57.340','little-cat-tire-town-school-11'),
